  - (c) triage the WebGPU Canary, which fails on every main push;
  - (d) add a parsimonious QuickCheck-style property: every sfw/nsfw bucket neo requests is served by waifu-mirror (TIN-4642).

**S5 merged:** #2163, #2164, #2168 (gpg-agent launches at login again; this delivers R-C231 with the batched neo switch, R-C232), #2169 (main presubmit analysis error) and #2173.

